 "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#5aa7f0\">Four clues</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#eef3fa\">Each clue gives one digit of the code.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#5aa7f0\">Four clues</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#eef3fa\">Each clue gives one digit of the code.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#f2c14e\">In teams</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#eef3fa\">Share the clues and help each other.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#f2c14e\">In teams</b><br><span style=\"font-size:23px;color:#eef3fa\">Share the clues and help each other.</span>",
